Package: chika
Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-pip
Maintainer: Chika <noreply@example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/tochi-mba/chika
Description: Agentic AI assistant with browser control
 Chika is a local-first agentic AI assistant featuring full browser
 control via a Chrome/Edge extension, multi-provider LLM support
 (Claude, OpenAI, Azure, Ollama), per-profile workspaces with
 password-protected memory, and a Claude Code-style CLI.
 .
 Includes ``chika doctor`` to verify the install, ``chika update`` for
 auto-updates from GitHub Releases, and ``chika install-extension`` to
 deploy the bundled browser extension to your home directory.
